  "dependencies": [
    {
      "mod_id": "base",
      "version": ">=0.6.0"
    }
  ],
  "description": "电竞大脑 (formerly 智能BP). One model of your save's meta - champion strength per patch, lanes, players' own strength and mastery, synergies and matchups - fitted in the background. League champions start from built-in League knowledge (lanes, team-composition profile, competitive tier, known combos and counters). Ban/pick screen: your line-up's win chance, the best picks now and, in every ban phase (3+2 included), the three best bans - valued by how much worse they make the enemy's draft, with reasons - or the bans the enemy wants against you; on your turn in a 3+2 draft the best candidates are played out to the end of the draft; both sides' composition style and gaps, the enemy's likely next picks from their habits, a value breakdown for the champion in the info panel, Fearless-series planning, and a BP review page in F8, each champion's value to you, each enemy pick's likely lane, and the best seating in the swap phase. Tactics screen: the options worth changing. Line-up screen: suggested starters. Meta Analysis page in the left menu (in the new UI: the title bar): champions, pairs, players and training, patch changes, the model. F8 anywhere: tier list, scouting, your players' pools. With coach delegation your own team bans and picks exactly what the panel advises (coach=on) - even with Hell Draft AI installed, which it also predicts: the enemy's likely picks, bans and the lookahead follow how Hell Draft AI drafts. AI Smart BP (ai_bp=on): every AI team bans and picks exactly the way this advice would have it, 3+2 lookahead included, over other draft mods. Champions start from their stats (learned from your matches), and the win chances are calibrated on matches the model was not fitted on. Can also nudge the AI's bans and picks (ban_pick, off by default; from game 0.6.4 around both teams' fielded players: their best champions) and keeps your tier list up to date. Balance patches (balance=on): this mod makes the patches instead of the game - every patch the champions furthest from a 48-52% win rate get stronger or weaker in every match, written into the game's own patch notes and patch history with the patch's news, and the ban/pick and encyclopedia stats show the new numbers. Every champion counts (2.10.0): each win-rate point outside the target moves balance_per_point (2.5% by default) of power, as much as a step was measured to need, up to 80% in all, and champions too rarely picked to judge get a small buff first (balance_unpicked) so that they get played. Item balance (item_balance=on, with alele's 4+6 item pack): the patches change the finished items too - an item whose builders win too much or too little gets its numbers changed, in its own news (2.12.0: the items are judged first, on 3 builders, 50 +- 1 and 10% a point, and the champions' changes count the items'; item_balance_users / _band / _per_point). 2.12.1: the game's item pages (encyclopedia, strategy popup) show a changed item's numbers as its holders play them. 2.12.2: the encyclopedia's patch history shows a patch's item changes too. 2.12.3 (game 0.7.3): the encyclopedia's champion page shows the patched numbers again (0.7.3 hid the page's champion name, which the mod read the champion from).2.11.0: the players' abilities in the model (each match record's abilities and lane rating), so a champion the strongest teams play is rated without its players - the Meta Analysis page shows what each champion's games owed their players and allies; champions whose numbers you change in the database keep exactly your numbers (the balance's earlier changes come off) and balance_skip / item_balance_skip leave the ones you list alone; the item news shows each item's icon; less work on the main screen (the news looked at around patch days only, the history file read in the background). 2.11.1 (game 0.7.3): the new Tank role is a group of its own in the stats part of the model. 2.13.0: the balance patches also set the health of the towers, the drakes and Baron (objective_balance): towers follow the matches' length (target 19-24 minutes), drakes and Baron how long one lives after it spawns, as a percentage in every match - the database keeps its numbers. 2.13.1: in the second ban phase of a 3+2 draft the coach and the AI no longer ban for a role the enemy has already filled (only bans that take something from their open lanes are played out). 2.13.2: AI teams switch to the strategy the model rates best whenever it is better (ai_tactics_margin, 0 by default; 0.1 before). 2.13.3: bans and the lookahead only count a champion in the lanes it plays (Smart Position Lock's lanes, else League's), so an enemy with its marksman picked is not banned another marksman. 2.14.0: every third game patch a theme patch that buffs one champion class together (balance_theme_every); every team keeps a style from its matches (e.g. loves assassins, engage), which AI BP picks lean toward without giving up more than ai_style win-rate points a pick, shown on the ban/pick screen. 2.14.1: in the second ban phase of a 3+2 draft the game hands the mods an incomplete pick list, so the coach and AI BP still banned marksmen against a filled bottom lane; each draft's picks (seen, and decided by this mod for either team) are now remembered and the missing ones filled in. 2.14.2: the balance patches talk like the game's own notes - each champion gets one of the game's reasons (too much damage, too tanky, strong for too long, rarely seen...) and a short win-rate line, the overall power is a line of the notes like a stat; the item changes are laid out like the champions' (buffs and nerfs, each item's numbers one a line) in the inbox and in the encyclopedia's patch history; items with no number that can change are no longer picked. 2.14.3: under each picked champion (both teams) a tag with its lane and its estimated win rate in that lane (lane_tags). 2.14.4: this mod's long news in the inbox (such as the item balance) scroll. 2.14.5: once the teams are seated (an AI team after its picks, yours in the swap phase) the tag under each pick follows the champion in that player's slot - its lane and win rate there; Smart Position Lock's seating is read (1.3.78+), AI teams no position lock seats are seated by this mod with ai_bp on, and your own swaps are followed; the match stories and patch previews are gone. 2.15.0: in a match, a live win chance under the clock - both sides' numbers, a bar and the curve so far, with the reason of a big swing (Baron, drakes, towers, a won fight); it reads the draft's win chance and the situation (gold, kills, towers, levels, drakes, Baron buff, champions alive) and learns from the matches the game simulates (live_win_chance; 2.15.1: matches are recorded again - a destroyed nexus is taken off the field). 2.15.2: this mod's long news in the inbox really scroll - click the news in the list. 2.15.3: coach delegation is off by default (coach=on turns it on; a settings.ini that says coach=on keeps it); AI BP and ban_pick stay off by default. 2.15.4: this mod's long news in the inbox scroll without a click (they get a minute of their own); item balance reasons follow the item's role and say when a change rolls an earlier one back. 2.15.5: with no position lock, your opponent in your own matches is seated by this mod so its lane / win-rate tags stay right (lane_tags). Old matches the game prunes are kept in the mod folder. Settings: settings.ini in the mod folder.\n\n用一个模型分析存档里的版本环境（英雄每个版本的强度、分位置、选手实力与熟练度、配合与克制）。英雄联盟英雄从内置的英雄联盟经验出发（位置、阵容属性、职业赛场梯队、知名配合与克制）。选人界面：阵容胜率、当前最佳选择；每个禁用阶段（含 3+2）给出最该禁的三个英雄——按禁掉后对方阵容变差多少来算，附理由——对方禁用时显示对方最想禁的；3+2 时轮到你会把最好的几个候选推演到 BP 结束再排序；显示双方阵容类型和缺口、按对方习惯推测的下一手、信息栏上方的估值明细、Fearless 系列赛的保留建议，F8 里有 BP 复盘页；每个英雄对你的价值、敌方英雄的位置推断、换位阶段的最佳分配。战术界面：值得改的战术。首发界面：推荐首发。左侧菜单（新界面在顶部标题栏）的版本分析页：英雄、组合、选手与训练建议、补丁变化、模型。任何界面按 F8：梯队榜、对手侦察、选手英雄池。教练托管时你自己的队伍完全照面板的建议禁和选（coach=on），装了地狱人机（Hell Draft AI）也一样；并能预测地狱人机：对方下一手、对方禁用和推演都按它的方式算。AI 智能BP（ai_bp=on）：所有 AI 队伍完全按本 Mod 的建议禁和选（含 3+2 推演），盖过其他 BP Mod。英雄从自身属性出发（从你的比赛学每项属性值多少），胜率按没参与拟合的比赛校准。可选改进 AI 的 ban/pick（ban_pick，默认关；游戏 0.6.4 起会看双方上场选手的拿手英雄）并自动维护梯队。版本平衡补丁（balance=on）：由本 Mod 代替游戏出补丁——每个版本把胜率离 48%–52% 最远的英雄在所有比赛里调强或调弱，写进游戏自己的补丁公告和补丁历史并发补丁新闻，BP 和百科的英雄属性显示改动后的数值。2.10.0 起照顾到所有英雄：每偏 1 个胜率点调 balance_per_point（默认 2.5%）的强度——按实测一刀该有的幅度——累计最多 80%，很少有人选、没法按胜率判断的英雄先小幅加强（balance_unpicked），让它们有机会上场。装备平衡（item_balance=on，需装 alele 的 4+6 装备包）：补丁也改成品装备——出它的英雄扣掉自身改动后胜率仍偏高或偏低的装备调整数值，单独发新闻。2.11.0：选手能力值进模型（每场比赛记录里选手的能力和位置评分），强队常用的英雄扣掉选手的贡献再评级，版本分析页显示每个英雄的表面胜率靠选手、阵容各得了多少；在数据库里改过数值的英雄完全按你的数值来（之前的平衡调整取消），balance_skip / item_balance_skip 列出的不调整；装备补丁新闻带图标；主界面卡顿优化（新闻只在补丁日前后常看，比赛备份在后台读）。2.11.1（游戏 0.7.3）：新加的坦克职业在模型的属性部分自成一组。2.12.3（游戏 0.7.3）：百科英雄页的「查看当前数值」重新显示补丁后的数值。2.13.0：平衡补丁也调防御塔、小龙、大龙的生命值（objective_balance）：塔看对局时长（目标 19–24 分钟），小龙大龙看刷新以后活多久，比赛里按百分比加减，数据库里的数值不变。2.13.1：3+2 第二轮禁用不会再禁对方已经选好的位置（只拿真能拿走对方东西的禁用去推演）。2.13.2：AI 队伍的战术只要模型认为更好就换（ai_tactics_margin，默认 0，以前要明显更好才换）。2.13.3：禁用和推演只在一个英雄会打的那几路里算它（位置锁的位置，没装就按英雄联盟的），对方已经拿了射手就不会再去禁射手。2.14.0：每隔 3 个游戏版本出一次主题版本，一类英雄一起加强（balance_theme_every）；每支队伍按自己的比赛形成风格（如「偏爱刺客 · 开团型」），AI BP 选人往风格上靠、每手最多让出 ai_style 个胜率点，对方风格显示在 BP 界面上。2.14.1：3+2 第二轮禁人时游戏给 Mod 的选人列表会漏掉几手，托管和 AI 智能BP 因此照样禁射手；现在记下同一场 BP 里看到的和自己替两边定的选人，漏掉的补上。2.14.2：平衡补丁照游戏官方补丁的口吻写——每个英雄先是一句官方的理由（输出过强、坦度过高、强势太久、无人问津……），再是一行短的胜率，整体强度和属性一样写成一行；装备改动在收件箱和百科补丁历史里照官方英雄补丁排版（增强、削弱两栏，一行一个数值）；没有可改数值的装备不再被挑中。2.14.3：双方每个已选英雄脚下一个小标签：位置和它在这一路的胜率（lane_tags）。2.14.4：收件箱里电竞大脑的长新闻（装备平衡等）可以往下滚。2.14.5：排好分路以后（AI 队选完人、你在换位阶段），每个已选英雄脚下的标签跟着这名选手格子里的英雄走，写这一格的位置和它在这一路的胜率；锁位置排的分路照它的（要 1.3.78），没有位置锁排时开着 ai_bp 的 AI 队由电竞大脑排，你自己的换位跟着你的点击记；删掉了赛前前瞻、赛后复盘和补丁预告。2.15.0：比赛中的实时胜率——比赛时间下面写两边的胜率，一条比例条和从开局到现在的胜率曲线，大起落时写原因（拿下大龙、小龙、推塔、打赢团战）；按 BP 完的阵容和此刻的经济、人头、塔、等级、小龙、大龙增益、活着几个人算，从游戏每天模拟的比赛里自己学（live_win_chance；2.15.1 修好了比赛记录：水晶被打掉后会从场上拿掉）。2.15.2：收件箱里电竞大脑的长新闻真的能滚了（在列表里点一下那条新闻）。2.15.3：教练托管默认关（写 coach=on 打开，已经写着 coach=on 的设置照旧），AI 智能BP 和 ban_pick 照旧默认关。2.15.4：收件箱里电竞大脑的长新闻不用点也能滚（长新闻挪到一个没有别的新闻的分钟）；装备平衡的理由按装备定位写，回调直说，出装胜率放句尾。2.15.5：没装位置锁时，你这一场对手的分路由电竞大脑来排，标签一直对得上（lane_tags）。游戏删掉的旧比赛会保存在 Mod 文件夹里。设置文件 settings.ini 在 Mod 文件夹里。",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-27",
  "mod_id": "patch_meta_ai",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "电竞大脑 Patch Meta AI: Draft Advisor, AI Teams, Tier List, Balance Patches",
  "version": "2.15.5"
}
